0.1.0 (2026-11-25):
- Variable scope: global or flow (new nodes: global, existing nodes keep flow) + context stores
- Works without opening the dialog first (old default name -1 → per-node name)
- rev / reset / noop accept "yes" or true
- Message properties (e.g. msg.topic) are kept
- Fixed: backward step when the stored value is above a new maximum
- New modern edit dialog (sections, live summary, spinners, validation), palette category "AFYA",
  Font Awesome icon, English UI with English + Polish help
- Short, consistent node status (value · time)
- MIT license, Node-RED >= 3.0, Node.js >= 18, unit tests (`npm test`)
- Edit dialog: new setting "Labels" – descriptions in Polish for a Polish system, English for all others,
  or chosen by hand (English / Polski); only the descriptions change, fields and values stay the same

0.0.5:
changed the way the carousel rewinds
carousel reset option added
added NOOP (no operation) option
corrected randomization of the variable name for flow (however, this requires opening the node for editing and saving it)

0.0.1:
- first version
